## call in `P/src/tests/CMakeLists.txt`, where `<set>` is the pack target for the
## authored set this bundle writes into (`unit`, `integration`, `shared` or
## `archive_fixture`). The census target is the one to name: the census cannot run as an
## ordinary unit, whatever dialect the bundle is.
##
## Write NO `ARCHES` keyword in that call. This bundle's descriptors declare no concrete
## architecture, so it ships on every arch its pack target was wired for, and omission is
## exactly how that is spelled.
##
## Census requires every case in the suite to execute without skipping, so only declare a
## suite that reads this bundle's shard and no other.
##
## EXPECTED_CASES is optional to configure and required for the census to mean what it
## claims: the guard's obligations come from the registered cases. Pin the TEST_F names.
